# Gonti, Night Minister only watches combat damage dealt to one of its controller's opponents. On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with Gonti
# and Bot2 blocks with a Walking Corpse: the damage goes to a creature, not a player, so nothing is exiled and the Corpse dies.
# On turn 4 Bot2's other Walking Corpse hits Bot1 (Gonti is still tapped): Bot1 is not Gonti's controller's opponent, so again
# nothing is exiled from Bot1's library. Bot2 casting its own Mox Jets and Corpses (spells it owns) made no Treasure either.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Gonti, Night Minister
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
